                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If we are to get our fiscal house in order, we have to tackle health care spending, which has ballooned to nearly 30% of our over $6T budget. This task force will be instrumental in addressing our health care cost inefficiencies to ensure we can take care of patients\u2019 needs & lower this massive budgetary line item.",
