                "text": "I appreciated hearing from Commissioner Bisignano in the Social Security and Work & Welfare Subcommittee Hearing on cyberattacks and the modernization of our Social Security records. Half of all medical records received by state disability determination services are received via mail or fax. We\u2019re working to make this process more efficient while still protecting Americans\u2019 data.",
