                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Chair of the House Budget Committee\u2019s Health Care Task Force, I\u2019m always looking at what drives costs in our health system. Declining physical activity has been linked to over $100 billion in annual health care costs. Beyond the financial implications, sedentary lifestyles also pose a significant threat to Americans\u2019 long-term quality of life. I introduced the Promoting Physical Activity for Americans Act with @RepJimmyPanetta to establish reliable guidelines on healthy standards for physicians, lawmakers, educators, and the public.",
